            'name' => $schema->string()->description('The application this report is about. Required — a bug report carries that project\'s inspection, health probe, last deploy and log tail, which is what makes it reproducible. The account name itself is never transmitted: it travels as a salted hash. Example: shop. Sent to the API as `project`.')->required(),
